{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47280","headline":"游仙二十四首 十七 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨登千仞岭，俯瞰四人居。\n原野间城邑，山河分里闾。\n眇彼埃尘中，争奔声利途。\n百龄宠辱尽，万事皆爲虚。\n自昔无成功，安能与尔俱。\n将期驾云景，超迹升天衢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}